OL,3,AShadow chancellor vows to cut at least
OL,4,Aone tax in every Tory budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FShadow chancellor Andrew Griffith said
OL,7,Fhe hopes to scrap at least one tax
OL,8,Fevery budget if the Conservatives
OL,9,Freturn to power, with the so-called
OL,10,F"mansion tax" in his sights.
OL,12,FSpeaking at the party's conference in
OL,13,FBirmingham, Griffith said "lower,
OL,14,Fsimpler and fairer taxes" would be his
OL,15,F"personal north star" although he noted
OL,16,Fhis ambition for cuts would take place
OL,17,F"only when we can afford to do so".
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
