OL,3,AShadow chancellor vows to cut at least
OL,4,Aone tax in every Tory budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe also said he would scrap the High
OL,7,FValue Council Tax Surcharge (HVCTS),
OL,8,Fwhich takes effect from 2028 and
OL,9,Fintroduces an extra levy for owners of
OL,10,Fproperties in England valued at more
OL,11,Fthan #2m.
OL,13,FLabour said the Tories "completely
OL,14,Ffailed at every turn" to grow the
OL,15,Feconomy during their 14 years in power.
